0..62 Comment "/// This source states unbiased composition of a path chain at"
63..87 Comment "/// a certified stratum."
88..91 Comment "///"
92..152 Comment "/// A chain has one composite across all of its bracketings."
153..200 Comment "/// The former therefore selects no bracketing."
201..204 Comment "///"
205..267 Comment "/// The sub-site for a chain certifies its stratum and degree."
268..335 Comment "/// Evaluation and the kernel use the left-nested `Path.step` fold."
